Z||000010||California Kid||11-18-2001||06:14 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jay:<BR><B>I think I'll see if there is a Cadillac club   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  That photo is cool KID.  So, did you play a little cat and mouse with anyone that night?<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Didn't play any cat and mouse, we spent a lot of time in the restaurant, had dinner, and too many brews to play around on the street.  Wish I hadn't had plans the next day, would have gone racing with them. From the looks of their times (and the fact that I know the track), I wouldn't have had any trouble in at least matching their best. I believe there were 5 or 6 Z06's running at the track.<P><p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 11-18-2001).]||||reg||1
